Notable issues caught and fixed during verification:
- `slate-quarry`: as `dana`, `[ -e ]` fails on a 0700 root-only dir, silently skipping the shred step → vault dir changed to mode 0711 (searchable, not listable) so the operator can stat but still needs sudo.
- `garnet-shard`: initial round function had key twins (k ≡ k^0x8080) making the subkey non-unique → added a rotl-1 step; verified all 65536 keys now have distinct round-function vectors and every fixture pair-set determines a unique key.
- `mica-marsh`: fixture template bug (module-level arrays referenced via `self.`) → regenerated.

